{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40014,"sections":[{"id":"script-20014","name":"原始脚本 20014","scripts":[20014],"start":0,"count":17}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:1","scriptId":20014,"text":"干掉了最后一批钢舞姬守卫。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:2","scriptId":20014,"text":"“还不错，活动身体确实会让人心情愉悦，不过这点数量说实在的还是有点累……。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":56,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:3","scriptId":20014,"text":"“这种时候，不知道埃普西隆去哪里鬼混了，她在的话，我可以省力点。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":56,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:4","scriptId":20014,"text":"“不过也就这样了，模拟世界的手感还是没有现实世界中的舒畅，差不多该通知德尔塔回去了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":56,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:5","scriptId":20014,"text":"正打算回去的兰布达耳边传来一阵电流声。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":56,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:6","scriptId":20014,"text":"“这个是传送？看来在回去之前还有一点最后可以收集的数据。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":56,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:7","scriptId":20014,"text":"传送下来了三批部队，距离兰布达的方位并不是特别远。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":56,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:8","scriptId":20014,"text":"“这头晕还是有点让人难以适应……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":56,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":27,"speaker":"莫夏·梅列茨安娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:9","scriptId":20014,"text":"“有个方法可以缓解，就是在传送的时候先闭眼，在传送到达之前不要睁开，能有效避免头晕哟～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":27,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:10","scriptId":20014,"text":"“你怎么不早说……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":27,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":644,"speaker":"玛鲁夏·德米特里耶夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:11","scriptId":20014,"text":"“哦呀，除了预想之中的目标以外，没想到另外两个小队也都在啊，这下我觉得心里有底了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":644,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:12","scriptId":20014,"text":"玛鲁夏昂了昂头，从她视线方向延伸过去正好可以看到另外两个小队，很明显那边已经汇合了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":644,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:13","scriptId":20014,"text":"说来也巧，那边好像也察觉到了这里的状况，开始往这边过来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":644,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":640,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:15","scriptId":20014,"text":"“哟，你们也到了啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":null,"right":640,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:16","scriptId":20014,"text":"“看来都是被波西娅传过来了啊，那目标就在眼前。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":8,"right":640,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:17","scriptId":20014,"text":"“恩，那个是兰布达……之前和她打过一场，那时候如果不是索菲亚教官的支援，估计是全军覆没……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":8,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":638,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20014:20014:18","scriptId":20014,"text":"“那就是说她很强咯？那么就来试试吧，反正也是必须消灭的目标。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":638,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
